c165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"咏梨花","author":"张雨","text":"折得瑶花第一枝，清明时节寄他谁。\n绝怜天上无真色，虢国夫人淡埽眉。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":9988,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"偶成","author":"张雨","text":"黄篾楼中枕书卧，双鹤交鸣惊梦破。\n青天堕下白云来，卷帘一阵杨花过。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":9989,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"御史入山","author":"张雨","text":"喜闻宰相入山来，急唤山童埽碧苔。\n云锁洞天三十六，楼台一一为君开。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":9990,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"读临川集","author":"张雨","text":"班马文章老琢磨，咎夔心迹半彫讹。\n执鞭愿作钟山吏，一袱字书随白骡。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":9991,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"春水","author":"张雨","text":"雪消岩溜注湾陂，便有微澜作渺瀰。\n时见幽人来照影，萧梁台畔立多时。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":9992,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"春酒","author":"张雨","text":"雪度青天落酒杯，花枝半拂角巾摧。\n陶公醉石苍苔满，不见猖狂李白来。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":9993,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"春烧","author":"张雨","text":"日落山前野烧生，白茅黄苇地初晴。\n明朝却赋雉带箭，呼酒冈头看火城。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":9994,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄冯海粟待制附天目僧过广陵 其一","author":"张雨","text":"天目峰头一鹤回，白云持赠当寒梅。\n琼花观里开包处，寄得玄砂白纸来。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":9995,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄冯海粟待制附天目僧过广陵 其二","author":"张雨","text":"三都一序争传赋，借重西州皇士安。\n惭愧山图经品藻，苦心留得后人看。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":9996,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄冯海粟待制附天目僧过广陵 其三","author":"张雨","text":"昨日淮南召八公，扬州拟看醉围红。\n赚人鸡犬云中去，策转江头控鹤童。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":9997,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"玄洲独坐偶成","author":"张雨","text":"檐外菁葱玉树排，小山丛桂近当阶。\n出云好看飙轮顶，云出飙轮忽被埋。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":9998,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"墨海棠","author":"张雨","text":"汉宫愁绝冷??，一蘸刘郎两鬓丝。\n甲帐夜寒银烛冷，六铢云帔独来时。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":9999,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"东坡书蔡君谟梦中绝句二放营妓绝句三虞伯生题四绝于后真迹藏义兴王子明家要予次韵凡九首 其一","author":"张雨","text":"日将公事湖中了，醉入重城列炬明。\n自古大藩财赋地，古人偏得赋閒情。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":