君谟梦中绝句二放营妓绝句三虞伯生题四绝于后真迹藏义兴王子明家要予次韵凡九首 其七","author":"张雨","text":"青城樵者一衰翁，写罢乌丝满袖风。\n消得玉堂金研匣，至今传入画图中。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10006,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"东坡书蔡君谟梦中绝句二放营妓绝句三虞伯生题四绝于后真迹藏义兴王子明家要予次韵凡九首 其八","author":"张雨","text":"听碾龙团怯醉魂，分茶故事与谁论。\n纤纤玉腕亲曾见，秪有春衫旧酒痕。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10007,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"东坡书蔡君谟梦中绝句二放营妓绝句三虞伯生题四绝于后真迹藏义兴王子明家要予次韵凡九首 其九","author":"张雨","text":"白公种竹苏公柳，谈笑功名后世誇。\n依旧葑云三万丈，断桥谁与筑堤沙。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10008,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"山中","author":"张雨","text":"一枝石瘦如麟角，六出花开似麝脐。\n随意莓苔一杯酒，也胜骑马听朝鸡。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10009,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"顾定之竹石","author":"张雨","text":"龙孙乍脱绷儿锦，石面都皴弹子窝。\n画妙通神欲飞去，虎头痴绝奈渠何。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10010,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"李仲宾雪竹","author":"张雨","text":"断缣黯淡何人墨，四十年前老蓟邱。\n向使戴家多种竹，雪中那肯便回舟。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10011,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"李鍊师云閒卷","author":"张雨","text":"朝随飞鹤出檐端，倦鸟纷纷莫与还。\n若似山居无用者，此身政不羡云閒。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10012,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"温日观蒲萄","author":"张雨","text":"日观一饮西凉酒，解写蒲萄绝代无。\n请师截断葛藤路，还我黑月摩尼珠。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10013,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"桂枝词","author":"张雨","text":"桂树丛生枝婀娜，糁粟黄云欲成朵。\n薰醒秋衣懒下床，金蟾啮断烧香锁。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10014,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"书道童总管赠蔡霞外诗后","author":"张雨","text":"多病潜夫懒入城，旋营草阁看阴晴。\n竹宫桂馆花繁处，乞与霞仙烂熳行。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10015,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"新居快雨戏笔","author":"张雨","text":"旋埽林扉一榻横，绿阴幽底水纹平。\n閒眠爱杀荷沟雨，玉磬池边无此声。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10016,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"子昂墨写萱草","author":"张雨","text":"碧浪湖头翰墨香，山蜂游趁午阴凉。\n戏拈小笔涂幽草，正自无忧得可忘。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10017,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"林泉高士图","author":"张雨","text":"我本玄真老孙子，意托纶钓相娱嬉。\n浮玉山前一瓢酒，颇恨时无颜太师。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10018,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"浔阳琵琶图","author":"张雨","text":"一幅面屏秋月圆，荻花枫叶染江天。\n江州自是无司马，多少琵琶上别船。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10019,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"马远小景二首 其一","author":"张雨","text":"柳未藏鸦雪未消，春衫游子马蹄骄。\n去年沽酒楼前路，错认桃花第一桥。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10020,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"马远小景二首 其二","author":"张雨","text":"玉砂卷海白模糊，千树梅花埽地无。\n彷佛水仙祠下路，金枝翠带不胜扶。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10021,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}}]